		<profileDesc>
			<abstract>
				<p>We present the first construction of multiparty distributed point functions based on one-way functions, where the share sizes remain sublinear in the domain size and grow only polynomially with the number of parties. In contrast, existing multiparty distributed point function constructions in Minicrypt have share sizes that grow exponentially with the number of parties.</p>
			</abstract>
